        Root cause:
        The bug was caused by the failure to log split shard failures when an IOException occurred during the update process. The original code caught the IOException but did not propagate it, leading to a lack of visibility into the error and potential issues with shard management.

        Commit message:
        SOLR-11182: A split shard failure on IOException should be
 logged  

        Patch:

   @Override
   public void split(SplitIndexCommand cmd) throws IOException {
     commit(new CommitUpdateCommand(cmd.req, false));
     SolrIndexSplitter splitter = new SolrIndexSplitter(cmd);
     splitCommands.mark();
     try {
       splitter.split();
     } catch (IOException e) {
       numErrors.increment();
       numErrorsCumulative.mark();
+      throw e;
     }
   }



